cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MamNexa AI in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MamNexa AI: An explainable AI framework for mammographic and molecular breast-cancer research"
abstract: >-
  MamNexa AI is a source-available, non-commercial research and educational
  framework demonstrating explainable AI methods for mammographic imaging
  (EfficientNet-B0 classification, U-Net segmentation, Grad-CAM attention) and
  cohort-relative transcriptomic pathway analysis. It is a research prototype,
  not a medical device, and makes no clinical-performance claims.
type: software
authors:
